{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25993","headline":"宿悟空寺赠僧 · 鲍溶","name":"宿悟空寺赠僧","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"劳者谣烛蛾，致身何营营。\n雪山本师在，心地如镜清。\n往与本师别，人间买浮名。\n朝光畏不久，内火烧人情。\n迷路喜爲远，宿留化人城。\n前心宛如此，了了随静生。\n维持薝卜花，却与前心行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍溶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25993.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25993","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}